2026-10-17, pairing
- Sign-in is now pairing with the user's Warpnet node: a QR scan or pasted
  connection data replaces the instance picker and OAuth. AddAccountsView, the
  Apps and Oauth endpoints, the OAuth token and app models and the
  instances.social client were removed. The app keeps one pairing; AppAccount
  names the paired node, and logging out unpairs the device on that node.
